# Backend API (bkkleague_backend)

The mobile app’s live backend is the **Next.js web app**, not Fastify.

- HTTP: `web/src/app/api/**/route.ts` in `bkkleague_backend` (nginx `/api` → Next.js)
- Sockets: `web/server.ts` (`agent` / `agent:*` for CueChat)
- Chat history: Postgres member threads (`/api/ai-agent/chat-threads`), not Redis `/chat/history`
- `bkkleague_backend/api/` (Fastify) is **reference only** — do not add or wire mobile features to it
